[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974310276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3974310276","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3974310276,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s4ymE","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:06:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T18:06:02Z","body":"thank you, you have no idea how long we spent trying to track that down <3","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974310276/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974311759","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3974311759","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3974311759,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s4y9P","user":{"login":"LilithSilver","id":84940819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTQwODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84940819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver","html_url":"https://github.com/LilithSilver","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:06:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T18:06:23Z","body":"THANK YOU SO MUCH HOLY HECK\r\n\r\nWe've been working on this for two days ;_;","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974311759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974382171","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3974382171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3974382171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s5EJb","user":{"login":"LilithSilver","id":84940819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTQwODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84940819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver","html_url":"https://github.com/LilithSilver","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:23:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T18:23:14Z","body":"I confirmed this fixes the issue on the repro.\r\n\r\nHowever, it introduces a new bug, where `reload_scene_from_path` can crash before the scene has actually loaded, because `selected_node` here ends up being nullptr. This can be reproduced by launching the repro and the reload spamming is happening during startup.\r\n\r\nThe issue here is get_handling_main_editor(nullptr):\r\n```c++\r\n\tif (get_edited_scene()) {\r\n\t\tif (editor_main_screen->can_auto_switch_screens()) {\r\n\t\t\t// Switch between 2D and 3D if currently in 2D or 3D.\r\n\t\t\tNode *selected_node = SceneTreeDock::get_singleton()->get_tree_editor()->get_selected();\r\n\t\t\tif (!selected_node) {\r\n\t\t\t\tselected_node = get_edited_scene();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\tconst int plugin_index = editor_main_screen->get_plugin_index(editor_data.get_handling_main_editor(selected_node));\r\n\t\t\tif (plugin_index >= 0) {\r\n\t\t\t\teditor_main_screen->select(plugin_index);\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974382171/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974422291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3974422291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3974422291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s5N8T","user":{"login":"LilithSilver","id":84940819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTQwODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84940819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver","html_url":"https://github.com/LilithSilver","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T18:31:01Z","body":"I've also reproduced a similar segfault: Again with the MRP from the issue, instead of selecting multiple nodes in the scene tree editor, take out the move tool and move a node. Reloading while moving then causes the same segfault, which this PR doesn't fix. \r\n\r\nI also was able to produce a similar issue when swapping from the \"Script\" pane to the \"2D\" pane. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974422291/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977098119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3977098119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3977098119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tDbOH","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T12:25:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T12:25:48Z","body":"> However, it introduces a new bug, where reload_scene_from_path can crash before the scene has actually loaded, because selected_node here ends up being nullptr. This can be reproduced by launching the repro and the reload spamming is happening during startup.\r\n\r\nCould not reproduce, any more details? The steps you describe seems to match the steps I commented in the original issue, which this patch should fix.\r\nSidenote: It's possible `selected_node` somehow still dangles, but I don't see how it can be equal to nullptr, if the outer if statement already guarantees `get_edited_scene()` to be non-null, and there's no multi-threading involved, which I believe is the case.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n> ... take out the move tool and move a node. Reloading while moving then causes the same segfault,\r\n\r\nCan reproduce; there's another dangling pointer (`drag_selection.front()->get()`, a `Node2D*`) in the 2D editor:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/15a4311583fbaad2eee5d2ecda5437eb9fd68c63/editor/scene/canvas_item_editor_plugin.cpp#L4156-L4158\r\n(I also tried the same thing with 3D editor and it interestingly handles the reload just fine)\r\n\r\nThere's no public method for resetting drag_selection yet, but it is also (indirectly) connected to `selection_changed` signal of `EditorSelection`. Now it seems clear to me that a better fix is to emit that signal, instead of accessing various singletons to clear selections. The problem is that currently the only way to emit the signal using public API, is to change the selection and then call `update()`, which *defers* emitting the signal. That won't help in this case, the whole issue in the first place is editor state being briefly inconsistent, due to deferred calls here and there.\r\n\r\nI'm pushing a new fix that allows `EditorSelection::update()` to immediately emit signal. It's implemented with an optional argument that toggles defer, so it won't affect existing code; it's also called only in a few places, so I think it's okay as a quick solution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977098119/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977139887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3977139887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3977139887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tDlav","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T13:03:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T13:03:01Z","body":"For the record, the deferred call seems to have been added in #14802\r\n\r\nMany deferred calls are simply there to ensure that something runs once per frame, mostly for performance (since updating stuff multiple times per frame is usually redundant).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977139887/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3985965436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3985965436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3985965436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tlQF8","user":{"login":"LilithSilver","id":84940819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTQwODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84940819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver","html_url":"https://github.com/LilithSilver","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilithSilver/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T17:55:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T17:55:16Z","body":"> Could not reproduce, any more details? The steps you describe seems to match the steps I commented in the original issue, which this patch should fix.\r\nSidenote: It's possible selected_node somehow still dangles, but I don't see how it can be equal to nullptr, if the outer if statement already guarantees get_edited_scene() to be non-null, and there's no multi-threading involved, which I believe is the case.\r\n\r\nTesting your new fix, I don't get the crash anymore. Awesome!\r\n\r\nI was unable to reproduce *any* segfault with the MRP, with any of the usual suspects. Double awesome! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3985965436/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999006239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116848#issuecomment-3999006239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116848","id":3999006239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uW_4f","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T17:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T17:24:25Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999006239/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]